1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:03,392
250 miles.

2
00:00:03,462 --> 00:00:05,928
10,000 aircraft.

3
00:00:06,058 --> 00:00:07,858
One beam.

4
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:11,374
July 11, 1934.

5
00:00:11,394 --> 00:00:13,962
On his 78th birthday,

6
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:17,704
Nikola Tesla told reporters about a beam

7
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:21,069
that could bring down 10,000 planes

8
00:00:21,202 --> 00:00:24,643
250 miles away.

9
00:00:24,663 --> 00:00:28,381
In 1937, he sent the plans

10
00:00:28,413 --> 00:00:30,435
to six governments.

11
00:00:30,577 --> 00:00:33,724
No working beam was ever shown.

12
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:37,801
Tesla died in January 1943.

13
00:00:37,933 --> 00:00:41,260
His papers were seized and reviewed.

14
00:00:41,394 --> 00:00:44,195
The verdict: nothing workable.

15
00:00:44,279 --> 00:00:47,941
Push charged particles with enough voltage,

16
00:00:48,029 --> 00:00:51,237
and they fly at nearly the speed of light.

17
00:00:51,346 --> 00:00:54,424
Every particle accelerator does it.

18
00:00:54,519 --> 00:00:56,921
The problem is air.

19
00:00:56,971 --> 00:01:00,656
In open air, the beam scatters and fades.

20
00:01:00,721 --> 00:01:03,653
Longshot asks how to fix that.

21
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:07,440
The first pulse heats a thin channel of air.

22
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,346
The air inside it thins out.

23
00:01:10,385 --> 00:01:13,295
The next pulse rides that channel,

24
00:01:13,413 --> 00:01:15,510
and pushes it further.

25
00:01:15,577 --> 00:01:18,999
Pulse after pulse, the beam stays tight.

26
00:01:19,038 --> 00:01:22,425
Width at the target: 4 cm.

27
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:25,592
Trial one. 50 km.

28
00:01:25,673 --> 00:01:27,473
Down.

29
00:01:27,548 --> 00:01:29,964
200 km.

30
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,800
Down.

31
00:01:31,875 --> 00:01:34,307
400 km.

32
00:01:34,327 --> 00:01:36,127
Down.

33
00:01:36,779 --> 00:01:38,976
One side effect.

34
00:01:39,087 --> 00:01:42,267
Every shot ends in a thunderclap,

35
00:01:42,404 --> 00:01:45,880
and radios fail for 10 km.

36
00:01:46,154 --> 00:01:49,420
Longshot is cleared for field trials.

37
00:01:49,615 --> 00:01:53,199
Tesla promised 250 miles.

38
00:01:53,221 --> 00:01:55,947
That's 400 km.
